To make the eraser work as a **Partial Eraser** (erasing only the parts of the drawing you touch) instead of an Object Eraser (deleting the whole shape), I will upgrade the logic in `Canvas.tsx`.

This works specifically for **Pencil** drawings:
1.  The code will check every tiny line segment of your drawing.
2.  If a segment touches the eraser, it gets "cut" out.
3.  The single drawing splits into multiple smaller drawings automatically.

For solid shapes like Rectangles and Circles, it will still delete the whole object, as vector partial erasing for those is mathematically much more complex.

